# Design Log Methodology

**The methodology for this repo lives in [`CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md), under "Design Log Methodology".** Read it there.

That section is the single source of truth: it carries the upstream design-log methodology plus the Jay-specific additions (validation-first prevention ordering, the shared-cause and serial-supersession tripwires, the boundary/multi-target fixture requirement, and the status-tagged index format).

This file intentionally holds no rules of its own — a second copy would drift from `CLAUDE.md` and feed the agent two conflicting versions of the same methodology.
